<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:55:11 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>麦肯锡的研究表明，人工智能创造的就业机会比自动化取代的就业机会还要多，但本十年将有 1100 万美国工人需要帮助</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/mckinsey-research-11-million-americans-new-job-next-decade/</link><description>我们的新研究发现，到 2035 年，美国经济的就业机会将比现在更多，但结构会有所不同。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-925078192.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/mckinsey-research-11-million-americans-new-job-next-decade/</guid></item><item><title>美国主教团长称国防部直播执行死刑的计划是“野蛮宣扬死亡文化”，教皇称死刑“不可接受”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/pope-leo-death-penalty-inadmissible-us-bishops-pentagon-livestream-execution-firing-squad/</link><description>“在不诉诸死刑的情况下，可以维护共同利益并满足正义的要求。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26281598867991-e1791729076655.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:39:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/pope-leo-death-penalty-inadmissible-us-bishops-pentagon-livestream-execution-firing-squad/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普禁止多家媒体后，白宫电视台停止报道，司法部正在调查新闻机构是否违反反垄断法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/doj-antitrust-investigation-news-organizations-white-house-tv-pool-coverage-trump-ban-cnn-msnbc-politico/</link><description>上个月，在政府禁止 CNN、MS NOW 和 Politico 进入白宫后，由五家广播公司组成的电视台停止了对总统的报道。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26268562328979-e1791728412492.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:28:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/doj-antitrust-investigation-news-organizations-white-house-tv-pool-coverage-trump-ban-cnn-msnbc-politico/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的关税迫使美国工厂关闭或解雇工人，长期的共和党选民正在反抗——“这就像在背后捅了一刀”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/trump-tariffs-factory-closures-layoffs-republican-voters-midterm-elections-democrats/</link><description>“对于恢复就业来说就这么多了，”范德米尔说。下个月，他计划在中期选举中直接投票给民主党。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26264196198139-e1791727721853.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:16:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/trump-tariffs-factory-closures-layoffs-republican-voters-midterm-elections-democrats/</guid></item><item><title>去年美国 192 亿美元的巨额礼物中，麦肯齐·斯科特一人就占了三分之一</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/mackenzie-scott-alone-accounted-for-one-third-of-americas-19-2-billion-in-megagifts-last-year/</link><description>麦肯齐·斯科特 (MacKenzie Scott) 在 2025 年捐赠了 70 亿美元，使她的五年捐赠总额达到 262 亿美元，尽管她一直远离聚光灯。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-2100039841-5-e1782327881933.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:18:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/mackenzie-scott-alone-accounted-for-one-third-of-americas-19-2-billion-in-megagifts-last-year/</guid></item><item><title>Twilio 首席执行官在晚餐时面试候选人 45 分钟，如果你说“我”太多或者不问任何问题，你就不会得到这份工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/twilio-ceo-interviews-candidates-for-45-minutes-over-dinner-hes-listening-for-one-word-in-particular-and-youre-not-hired-if-you-say-it-too-much/</link><description>独家报道：Twilio 首席执行官 Khozema Shipchandler 警告求职者，两个常见的面试错误可能会让他们失去工作：跳过问题或过于依赖“我”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/GettyImages-1485222107-e1757415514967.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:15:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/twilio-ceo-interviews-candidates-for-45-minutes-over-dinner-hes-listening-for-one-word-in-particular-and-youre-not-hired-if-you-say-it-too-much/</guid></item><item><title>打破债券市场的鹰派美联储主席？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/the-hawk-fed-chair-who-broke-the-bond-market/</link><description>凯文·沃什可能是继保罗·沃尔克之后最鹰派的美联储主席。九月份的财政部溃败表明了这样做的代价。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2295051976-e1791634201180.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/the-hawk-fed-chair-who-broke-the-bond-market/</guid></item><item><title>来认识一下 Aurora：每年 10,000 美元的人工智能礼宾服务，仅限受邀者参加，可预测超级富豪的每一个需求</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/meet-aurora-invite-only-ai-concierge-ultrawealthy-pay-10000-a-year-to-anticipate-their-every-need/</link><description>在风投和家族办公室 1200 万美元的支持下，Aurora 将人工智能与人类时尚引领者结合起来，管理会员的健康、旅行和餐饮。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/aurora-e1791574104925.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:29:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/meet-aurora-invite-only-ai-concierge-ultrawealthy-pay-10000-a-year-to-anticipate-their-every-need/</guid></item><item><title>Ancestry 的首席执行官表示，一位亿万富翁老板教他在休息室与员工共进午餐，这让他能够访问“未经过滤的信息”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/ancestry-ceo-career-advice-lunch-with-employees-break-room/</link><description>Ancestry 的霍华德·霍克豪瑟 (Howard Hochhauser) 表示，首席执行官们“陷入了这个泡沫”。苹果和多邻国的高管们也通过与员工分享面包来摆脱束缚。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Howard-RootsTech71-copy-e1791573464484.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:22:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/ancestry-ceo-career-advice-lunch-with-employees-break-room/</guid></item><item><title>看不见的手需要良心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/capitalism-conscience-wealth-philanthropy/</link><description>资本主义看不见的手可以创造财富。它无法决定我们彼此欠什么。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2272993074-e1791316214784.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/capitalism-conscience-wealth-philanthropy/</guid></item></channel></rss>